# Normalize to LF in the repo. Scripts and configs run inside Linux containers,
# where a Windows CRLF breaks them (e.g. "/bin/sh^M: not found").
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
# Shell scripts run inside the Linux VM: keep LF line endings even when committed from Windows.
*.sh text eol=lf
Vagrantfile text eol=lf